Order-5 fixed projection gate for the putative Type II [72,36,16] code
A16(W72)=249849, so fixed minimum words must be congruent to 4 mod 5
Assumed cycle shape: 5^14 1^2; fixed projection length = 14+2 = 16
Extremal obstruction: no nonzero fixed word may lift to weighted length < 16

