== Derived order-5 gate ==
e8+e8 survives exactly when the two fixed coordinates lie in different e8 blocks: 64 valid marked pairs, each with fixed_A16=14 congruent to W72 A16 mod 5.
d16+ has every coordinate pair covered by a tetrad, so every marking creates a fixed word of lifted weight 12; d16+ is excluded from an extremal order-5 fixed projection.
Therefore any order-5 automorphism of an extremal [72,36,16] code with shape 5^14 1^2 forces a partition of the fourteen 5-cycles into two heptads, one heptad plus one fixed point in each e8 block.
The fixed weight-16 words are exactly 14, leaving 249835 nonfixed minimum words = 49967 orbits of size 5.

